Modified files
--------------
As required by section 4(b) of the Apache License 2.0, every file inherited
from Theatrical that this fork has changed carries a prominent notice at the
top of the file stating that it was changed by Mica Technologies, and why.
Files whose format cannot carry a comment (JSON, images, binaries) are listed
instead in CHANGELOG-FORK.md. A running summary of all fork changes is kept in
the "What this fork changes" section of README.md.

